d carry documentation-edit vocabulary.\n\n  Line 131: - [ ] T056 Make one correction at the source T055 names: remove a token a skill holds only through a harvest artifact, or add a general documentation-edit term to the `sk-doc` source field T055 names. The change adds no string of two or more consecutive words from the `nm-sk-doc-01` prompt. When the file is a deriver input, run `node $D`. Verify: for each two-word window of the prompt, `git -c core.fsmonitor=false diff HEAD -U0 -- <changed file> | rg -F \"<window>\"` prints nothing, `node $D --check | jq -r .status` prints `fresh`, and after `npm run build` in `ADV`, `node $S/nm-sk-doc-probe.mjs` prints `sk-doc` with the highest score.\n\n  Line 134: - [ ] T057 Run `npm run build` in `ADV`, then `node $C --write`. Verify: `jq -c '.rows[\"nm-sk-doc-01\"] | {top, offered}' $ADV/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-routing-baseline.json` prints `{\"top\":\"sk-doc\",\"offered\":false}`, `node $C | $M` prints typed at least 24 of 44, tune combined at least 9 of 45, holdout combined at least 0 of 44 and false offers 0 of 35, and `$P` prints numbers no lower than `[159,50,20]` with false fire no higher than 5. If any is worse, revert T056 and mark it `[B]` with the printed numbers.\n\n  Line 231: - [ ] CHK-024 [P1] `nm-sk-doc-01` tops at `sk-doc` with no recall or pinned number lower (T057).\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"pattern\":\"nm-sk-doc|documentation-edit|harvest artifact|source field\",\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/005-recommendation-contract-and-brief\",\"include\":\"*.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794522502435,"end":1794522503973}}}}
