{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794522515535,"sessionID":"ses_e2e22251effedzgdgxW9ZYGzGw","part":{"id":"prt_1d1e0884f001Qvw3uLkd5BXlYj","sessionID":"ses_e2e22251effedzgdgxW9ZYGzGw","messageID":"msg_1d1e07af6001UmVP6UGrpZXu7u","type":"step-start","snapshot":"6256f81f3466315d0b602ef7caa9223d9aef7bc0"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794522528291,"sessionID":"ses_e2e22251effedzgdgxW9ZYGzGw","part":{"partID":"prt_1d1e0b58a001UHMS5i6b8i1x9Y","sessionID":"ses_e2e22251effedzgdgxW9ZYGzGw","messageID":"msg_1d1e07af6001UmVP6UGrpZXu7u","type":"tool","id":"call_f4ca624c4c7b4adabcad1a42","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && echo '== sk-doc frontmatter description + keywords' && sed -n '1,20p' .skilled/skills/sk-doc/SKILL.md && echo '== sk-design SKILL.md description/keywords' && sed -n '1,12p' .skilled/skills/sk-design/SKILL.md && echo '== doctor SKILL.md keywords' && sed -n '24,34p' .skilled/skills/system-skilled-doctor/SKILL.md"},"output":"== sk-doc frontmatter description + keywords\n---\nname: sk-doc\ndescription: \"Documentation & component authoring hub: skills, agents, commands, READMEs, catalogs, playbooks, changelogs, goals, frontmatter.\"\nallowed-tools: [Read, Write, Edit, Bash, Grep, Glob]\nversion: 2.9.13.0\nmetadata:\n  family: sk-util\n---\n\n<!-- Keywords: sk-doc, documentation, markdown, authoring, parent-hub, mode-registry, hub-router, workflowmode, packetkind, sk-create-skill, sk-create-readme, sk-create-agent, sk-create-command, sk-create-feature-catalog, sk-create-manual-testing-playbook, sk-create-benchmark, sk-create-changelog, sk-create-diff, sk-create-repo-rule, sk-create-frontmatter, sk-create-goal, sk-create-with-human-voice, sk-create-quality-control, human-voice-rules, hvr, shared-backbone, create-quality-control-pipeline -->\n\n# Documentation Authoring Hub (sk-doc)\n\nOne advisor identity, fifteen workflow modes across fourteen packets, one shared sk-create-quality-control backbone.\n`sk-doc` is the parent hub for documentation and OpenCode-component authoring.\nIt holds NO per-packet logic: it routes by `workflowMode` through `mode-registry.json`, and each packet keeps its own contract in its nested folder.\nThe cross-cutting sk-create-quality-control pipeline (validators, global standards, frontmatter/llms/template assets) lives once in `shared/` and is consumed by every packet.\n\n**Version authority.** This file's `version` frontmatter is the hub's release version and matches the newest entry under `changelog/`; `description.json`, `mode-registry.json` and `hub-router.json` carry the same value, so every hub-root JSON routing file states the same release; `ROUTER.md` keeps its own document version.\n\n== sk-design SKILL.md description/keywords\n---\nname: sk-design\ndescription: \"Design parent hub. Routes one design identity to the mode that owns the artifact: a measured Style Reference, a chart or a diagram.\"\nallowed-tools: [Read, Write, Edit, Bash, Grep, Glob]\nversion: 3.0.2.0\nmetadata:\n  family: sk-design\n---\n\n<!-- Keywords: design, style reference, design.md, extract design tokens, chart, diagram, flowchart -->\n\n# Design (parent hub)\n== doctor SKILL.md keywords\n- A project's runtime folders, environment switches, `AGENTS.md` sections, trigger index or Code Mode registration need checking against what Skilled ships.\n- A project that vendors Skilled needs its own changes, its overlays, applied or checked after the copy changed.\n- A problem is described and the right doctor command is not known yet.\n\n**Keyword Triggers**:\n- \"put Skilled into my project\", \"install Skilled\", \"link the Skilled checkout\"\n- \"update Skilled\", \"runtime mirrors\", \"environment switches\", \"doctor setup\"\n- \"which doctor command\", \"AGENTS.md sections\", \"trigger index fresh\", \"Code Mode install\"\n- \"vendored Skilled\", \"Skilled overlays\", \"overlay status\", \"apply the overlays\"\n\n### When NOT to Use\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"== sk-doc frontmatter description + keywords\n---\nname: sk-doc\ndescription: \"Documentation & component authoring hub: skills, agents, commands, READMEs, catalogs, playbooks, changelogs, goals, frontmatter.\"\nallowed-tools: [Read, Write, Edit, Bash, Grep, Glob]\nversion: 2.9.13.0\nmetadata:\n  family: sk-util\n---\n\n<!-- Keywords: sk-doc, documentation, markdown, authoring, parent-hub, mode-registry, hub-router, workflowmode, packetkind, sk-create-skill, sk-create-readme, sk-create-agent, sk-create-command, sk-create-feature-catalog, sk-create-manual-testing-playbook, sk-create-benchmark, sk-create-changelog, sk-create-diff, sk-create-repo-rule, sk-create-frontmatter, sk-create-goal, sk-create-with-human-voice, sk-create-quality-control, human-voice-rules, hvr, shared-backbone, create-quality-control-pipeline -->\n\n# Documentation Authoring Hub (sk-doc)\n\nOne advisor identity, fifteen workflow modes across fourteen packets, one shared sk-create-quality-control backbone.\n`sk-doc` is the parent hub for documentation and OpenCode-component authoring.\nIt holds NO per-packet logic: it routes by `workflowMode` through `mode-registry.json`, and each packet keeps its own contract in its nested folder.\nThe cross-cutting sk-create-quality-control pipeline (validators, global standards, frontmatter/llms/template assets) lives once in `shared/` and is consumed by every packet.\n\n**Version authority.** This file's `version` frontmatter is the hub's release version and matches the newest entry under `changelog/`; `description.json`, `mode-registry.json` and `hub-router.json` carry the same value, so every hub-root JSON routing file states the same release; `ROUTER.md` keeps its own document version.\n\n== sk-design SKILL.md description/keywords\n---\nname: sk-design\ndescription: \"Design parent hub. Routes one design identity to the mode that owns the artifact: a measured Style Reference, a chart or a diagram.\"\nallowed-tools: [Read, Write, Edit, Bash, Grep, Glob]\nversion: 3.0.2.0\nmetadata:\n  family: sk-design\n---\n\n<!-- Keywords: design, style reference, design.md, extract design tokens, chart, diagram, flowchart -->\n\n# Design (parent hub)\n== doctor SKILL.md keywords\n- A project's runtime folders, environment switches, `AGENTS.md` sections, trigger index or Code Mode registration need checking against what Skilled ships.\n- A project that vendors Skilled needs its own changes, its overlays, applied or checked after the copy changed.\n- A problem is described and the right doctor command is not known yet.\n\n**Keyword Triggers**:\n- \"put Skilled into my project\", \"install Skilled\", \"link the Skilled checkout\"\n- \"update Skilled\", \"runtime mirrors\", \"environment switches\", \"doctor setup\"\n- \"which doctor command\", \"AGENTS.md sections\", \"trigger index fresh\", \"Code Mode install\"\n- \"vendored Skilled\", \"Skilled overlays\", \"overlay status\", \"apply the overlays\"\n\n### When NOT to Use\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && echo '== sk-doc frontmatter description + keywords' && sed -n '1,20p' .skilled/skills/sk-doc/SKILL.md && echo '== sk-design SKILL.md description/keywords' && sed -n '1,12p' .skilled/skills/sk-design/SKILL.md && echo '== doctor SKILL.md keywords' && sed -n '24,34p' .skilled/skills/system-skilled-doctor/SKILL.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794522527114,"end":1794522528291}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794522528308,"sessionID":"ses_e2e22251effedzgdgxW9ZYGzGw","part":{"partID":"prt_1d1e0b138001OcdioF7Y7FdnjS","sessionID":"ses_e2e22251effedzgdgxW9ZYGzGw","messageID":"msg_1d1e07af6001UmVP6UGrpZXu7u","type":"tool","id":"call_6eafa6ea8f9b48deb4807558","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && sqlite3 .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/database/skill-graph.sqlite \"select derived from skill_nodes where id='system-skilled-doctor';\" | jq -r '.trigger_phrases[]? | select(test(\"setup\";\"i\"))' 2>&1; echo '--- raw derived keys'; sqlite3 .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/database/skill-graph.sqlite \"select derived from skill_nodes where id='system-skilled-doctor';\" | jq -r 'keys' 2>&1"},"output":"--- raw derived keys\n[\n  \"causal_summary\",\n  \"created_at\",\n  \"entities\",\n  \"key_files\",\n  \"key_topics\",\n  \"last_updated_at\",\n  \"source_docs\",\n  \"trigger_phrases\"\n]\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"--- raw derived keys\n[\n  \"causal_summary\",\n  \"created_at\",\n  \"entities\",\n  \"key_files\",\n  \"key_topics\",\n  \"last_updated_at\",\n  \"source_docs\",\n  \"trigger_phrases\"\n]\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && sqlite3 .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/database/skill-graph.sqlite \\\"select derived from skill_nodes where id='system-skilled-doctor';\\\" | jq -r '.trigger_phrases[]? | select(test(\\\"setup\\\";\\\"i\\\"))' 2>&1; echo '--- raw derived keys'; sqlite3 .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/database/skill-graph.sqlite \\\"select derived from skill_nodes where id='system-skilled-doctor';\\\" | jq -r 'keys' 2>&1\"}"},"time":{"start":1794522526008,"end":1794522528308}}}}
